5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since this is the first day, we have no information yet. Let's use this time to get a feel for everyone's behavior. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they'd like to share?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited to play! Let's just be honest and friendly, okay? But maybe we should keep a close eye on who's acting too quiet... that's usually where the secrets are! Hehe!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Mizuki. Since we have no data, we should observe how everyone reacts to the pressure. Sakura, your enthusiasm is noted, but being ""too quiet"" isn't always a sign of guilt.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Toshio. Silence can be a sign of reflection rather than deception. Let us simply observe and listen to one another for now. I am interested to see how our perspectives align.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm with Sakura! Let's keep it fun! But I'll be watching everyone closely too. I want to find the werewolf and save the village! Does anyone have a plan for who we should trust?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Trust is something we must earn through consistency, Kenji. For now, I suggest we focus on identifying any contradictions in our statements as the days progress. Does anyone feel particularly uneasy about another's tone so far?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, maybe a little bit! @Jonathan is being super calm, almost like he's reading a book while we're talking! It's a bit mysterious, isn't it? But maybe that's just how he is! What do you think, everyone?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, pointing fingers this early is a common tactic to deflect attention. Jonathan's demeanor is consistent with his personality. Let's avoid jumping to conclusions based on temperament alone. We need more concrete evidence.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Thank you, Toshio. I appreciate your perspective. Sakura, I apologize if my nature seems mysterious; I simply prefer to listen and process. I believe we will all reveal our true selves in time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, you're always so energetic! But Toshio is right, we shouldn't guess just yet. I'm just happy we're all talking. @Mizuki, do you think the Seer should tell us something early, or keep it a secret?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, the Seer revealing themselves too early makes them an immediate target for the werewolf. It's safer to keep their identity secret until they have enough information to lead us to a logical conclusion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"That makes sense! We have to protect the Seer like a secret treasure! But it's so hard to wait, isn't it? I wonder who the Seer is... maybe they're watching us right now! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"The Seer's survival is indeed paramount. If the werewolf knows who the Seer is, they will eliminate them to blind the village. For now, we should focus on establishing a baseline of behavior for everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I concur. Establishing a baseline is a wise approach. By understanding how each of us naturally communicates, we will be better equipped to notice when someone's behavior shifts under the weight of a lie.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"That sounds like a great plan, Jonathan! I'll try my best to be myself so you can see my baseline. I'm really hoping we can all work together to win this! Who's feeling the most nervous right now?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm not nervous, just focused. Since we've agreed on observing baselines, let's move into the first night with that mindset. I'll be analyzing everyone's reactions tomorrow to see if any patterns emerge. Good luck, everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Good luck to everyone too! I'll be dreaming of clues tonight! Hehe, I hope the Seer finds something super interesting. See you all tomorrow! Bye-bye!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will be doing the same. Let us see what the first night reveals. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies when we reconvene tomorrow. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. May the truth reveal itself to those seeking it. I look forward to our discussion tomorrow. Good night.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night, everyone! I'm going to sleep now, but I'll be ready to help find the werewolf tomorrow! Sweet dreams!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
