35,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Now that the first night has passed, we should see if anyone has information to share. If the Seer found something, they must decide if revealing it now is worth the risk. Does anyone have any observations?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I wonder if the Seer found a big secret! @Toshio, you're always so serious and observant, did you notice anything spooky last night? Or maybe someone else knows something? Tell us, tell us! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your curiosity is as relentless as ever. As I mentioned before, revealing the Seer's identity too early is a risk. However, since we must act, I will state that I have information. Kenji is the werewolf.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Toshio, that is a very bold and direct claim. If you are indeed the Seer, this is a critical piece of information. @Kenji, how do you respond to this accusation?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! @Toshio, that's not true! I'm not the werewolf! I really want to save the village! Why would you say that? Please tell me you're joking! I'm just a regular guy!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, you've revealed yourself as the Seer very quickly. While it's a bold move, it provides us with a clear lead. @Kenji, your reaction is quite emotional; however, emotion isn't proof of innocence. Does anyone doubt Toshio's claim?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, Toshio! You really just said it! That's so dramatic! @Kenji, you look so surprised, it's almost funny! But if Toshio is the Seer, then we have to believe him, right? This is getting so exciting!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, the risk of remaining silent outweighs the risk of exposure when the werewolf is identified on night zero. @Kenji, your denial is expected, but the divination is absolute. I am certain of my result.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Toshio is the Seer, the logic is simple: Kenji must be executed. However, we must consider if this is a gamble by the werewolf to frame an innocent. @Mizuki, do you find Toshio's timing too convenient?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, thank you for thinking about that! I'm really not the werewolf! @Toshio, why are you lying? This isn't a joke! Please, everyone, don't believe him! I'm just a villager who wants to help!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, it is a risk, but Toshio's behavior has been consistent. If he were the werewolf framing Kenji, he would be risking his own life for a single kill. @Kenji, your desperation is noted, but the logic favors Toshio.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, you're acting so panicked! It's almost like you're in a movie! But @Toshio is usually so careful, so if he says you're the bad guy, it must be true! Sorry, Kenji, but the Seer is the boss here! Hehe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, your panic does not change the result of the divination. @Jonathan, @Mizuki, the most logical course of action to ensure the village's victory is to execute the werewolf now. I am prepared to accept the consequences of my reveal.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find it difficult to ignore the Seer's direct evidence. While I remain cautious, the probability of Toshio lying as the werewolf is lower than the probability of Kenji lying to survive. I am inclined to trust the divination.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, please! You're usually so fair! @Mizuki, @Sakura, you have to believe me! I've been honest since the start! If you execute me, the real werewolf will still be here and we'll lose! Please, just give me one more chance!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The evidence is overwhelming. @Toshio has put his life on the line by revealing himself as the Seer. @Kenji, your pleas are heartfelt, but logic dictates we follow the divination. I will vote for Kenji. Everyone, let's decide.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm sorry, Kenji, but the Seer's word is like magic! It's too strong to ignore! I'll vote for Kenji too. Bye-bye, Kenji! I hope you're not actually a scary wolf! Hehe!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"The decision is clear. To ensure the safety of the village, we must act on the information I have provided. I will vote for Kenji. Let us end this threat now.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I have weighed the possibilities, and the logic presented by Toshio is the most sound. To ignore a direct divination would be an unnecessary risk to the village. I will also vote for Kenji.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I can't believe this! Everyone is just going to believe him without any other proof? I'm not the werewolf! Please, don't do this! If you kill me, you're making a huge mistake! I'll vote for myself since you've already decided...","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
